msgid "Average number of days per week employees commute to the office."
msgstr "員工平均每星期返回辦公室工作的日數。"

#. module: esg_hr_fleet
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:esg_hr_fleet.emitted_emission_from_account_form_view
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:esg_hr_fleet.other_emission_form_view
msgid ""
"Commuting emissions reflect home-office distance, weekly attendance,\n"
"                    and vehicle CO₂ emissions for all employees, using data "
"from the Employee\n"
"                    and Fleet apps."
msgstr ""
"「通勤交通排放量」反映所有員工由居所往返辦公地點的距離、每週出勤次數，\n"
"                    以及車輛的二氧化碳排放量，根據員工\n"
"                    及車隊應用程式的數據計算。"

